keywords:
  - matrix multiplication
  - formal verification
  - Lean
  - computer-assisted proof
  - optimization
abstract: >-
  An exact certificate establishes the rational-field matrix multiplication
  exponent bound omega_Q <= 43740354192942056903/18446744073709551616
  under profile CN. The trust boundary includes native evaluation,
  Classical.choice, propext, Quot.sound, MatrixMath.AX1_combination_loss,
  and the relevant Lean compiler/runtime/GMP components.
